# The image build only needs Go sources, migrations and the already-built SPA
# at cmd/teamup/web/dist. Everything below would otherwise be shipped into the
# build context — web/node_modules alone is hundreds of megabytes once the
# frontend has been built on the same machine.
#
# Note what is NOT here: cmd/teamup/web/dist. It is gitignored but the Go embed
# needs it, so it must reach the build context.

.git
.github
.claude
.scratch
.agents

web/node_modules
web/dist
web/.vite
node_modules

bin/
dist/
coverage.out
*.log

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
helm/
docs/
